<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

  <PropertyGroup>
    <Version>1.0.0</Version>
    <Copyright>Copyright (c) 2026 Nikolay Kostov</Copyright>
    <Authors>Nikolay.IT</Authors>
    <Product>Backgammon (Табла) Bots</Product>
    <PackageId>BackgammonGameEngine.Bots</PackageId>
    <Description>Computer players for BackgammonGameEngine: six levels for обикновена, гюлбара, тапа, челеби and среща, from a TD-Gammon-style neural network per version down to calibrated weaker levels. Deterministic for a given view, level and Random, and fast (well under 20 ms a decision).</Description>
    <PackageTags>backgammon;tabla;табла;bot;neural network;td-gammon;game ai</PackageTags>
    <PackageLicenseExpression>MIT</PackageLicenseExpression>
    <PackageProjectUrl>https://github.com/NikolayIT/BackgammonGameEngine</PackageProjectUrl>
    <PackageIcon>Logo_300x300.png</PackageIcon>
    <PackageReadmeFile>README.md</PackageReadmeFile>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>
1.0.0 (the first release)

- BackgammonBot: six levels for every version, deciding from a seat view alone, deterministic for a view, level and
  Random, and fast. Level 6 is a TD-Gammon-style network per version (or the hand-written evaluator where the network
  did not beat it), aware of the match score; levels 1..5 add calibrated noise.
- A complexity estimate per decision, for pacing a bot's think time.
    </PackageReleaseNotes>
    <RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/NikolayIT/BackgammonGameEngine</RepositoryUrl>
    <RepositoryType>git</RepositoryType>
    <PublishRepositoryUrl>true</PublishRepositoryUrl>
    <EmbedUntrackedSources>true</EmbedUntrackedSources>
    <IncludeSymbols>true</IncludeSymbols>
    <SymbolPackageFormat>snupkg</SymbolPackageFormat>
    <GenerateDocumentationFile>true</GenerateDocumentationFile>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <InternalsVisibleTo Include="Backgammon.AI.Tests" />
    <InternalsVisibleTo Include="Backgammon.Arena" />
    <InternalsVisibleTo Include="Backgammon.Trainer" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <!-- The trained networks, one per version that passed the gate (see NEURAL_NETWORK.md). -->
    <EmbeddedResource Include="Neural\Weights\*.bin" LogicalName="Backgammon.AI.Neural.Weights.%(Filename)%(Extension)" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <ProjectReference Include="..\Backgammon.Logic\Backgammon.Logic.csproj" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <None Include="..\..\assets\Logo_300x300.png" Pack="true" PackagePath="" />
    <None Include="README.md" Pack="true" PackagePath="" />
  </ItemGroup>

</Project>
